WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v HOST>How would you choose a small weekly practice?</v>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:28.000
<v GUEST>I would start with something I want to learn and one action I can observe. Suppose I want to sketch more often. I could place a notebook on the table and try ten minutes after lunch.</v>

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
<v HOST>Would that tell you why the practice worked?</v>

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:54.000
<v GUEST>No. It would tell me what happened under those conditions. If I sketch on three afternoons, I still cannot separate the effect of the notebook from other changes that week.</v>

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:02.000
<v HOST>What would you record when you miss a day?</v>

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:23.000
<v GUEST>If I remember the event, I record the event. If I do not know, I leave it unknown. Calling myself lazy would not tell me whether I was interrupted, forgot, or chose something else.</v>

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v HOST>What decision does the record help you make?</v>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:50.000
<v GUEST>It helps me choose the next small experiment. I might keep the setup, change the time, or decide that sketching is not what I want to practice now. The record supports that choice; it does not make it for me.</v>
